data: {"id": "79b3cac9a7fe478e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1158", "run_id": "79b3cac9a7fe478e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据 kubectl 诊断结果，事实如下：\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`Running`，但 `Ready=False`，等待原因为 `CrashLoopBackOff`。重启 27 次。\n2. **终止原因**：`Last State` 显示 `Reason: OOMKilled`，`Exit Code: 137`。\n3. **容器配置**：\n   - `Limits`: `memory: 64Mi`\n   - `Requests`: `memory: 8Mi`\n   - `Command`: `python3 -u -c ... print('startup allocation 256Mi', flush=True); memory=bytearray(256*1024*256); time.sleep(86400)`\n4. **冲突与事实**：\n   - 容器命令中明确尝试分配 `256 * 1024 * 1024` (即 256 MiB) 的 `bytearray`。\n   - 而 Pod 的 `memory limit` 仅为 `64Mi`。\n   - 容器启动日志", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789385044836, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

