data: {"id": "79b3cac9a7fe478e-final", "run_id": "79b3cac9a7fe478e", "seq": 1163, "ts_ms": 1789385062577, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v15/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | CrashLoopBackOff |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning BackOff restarting failed container app` (x535 over 117m) | 证实异常组现象为反复崩溃 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason: OOMKilled` | 证实最近一次崩溃机制 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `Exit Code: 137` | 配合 OOMKilled 机制，证实进程被系统强制终止 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.app.memory limit: 64Mi` | 确认该容器的硬内存限制，构成 OOM 的必要条件 |\n| 5 | Logging | elasticsearch | `log.message: startup allocation 256Mi` | 证实容器在启动阶段尝试分配 256Mi 内存 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason=1` (reason=OOMKilled) | Metric 维度印证容器终止原因为 OOM |\n\n**证据链说明：**\n事实 #4 提供的 `64Mi` 硬限制与事实 #5 记录的 `256Mi` 启动分配量存在直接的数量级冲突。事实 #2 和 #3 表明这种资源违规触发了 Linux OOM Killer 机制。事实 #1 证实该机制导致容器进入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 循环。Metric 事实 #6 从聚合指标维度确认了终止状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n容器启动脚本尝试分配 256Mi 内存 (Logging) → 超过 64Mi 的 memory limit 硬限制 (K8s Config) → 触发 OOMKilled (Exit Code 137) (K8s State) → CrashLoopBackOff (K8s Event)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认根因为：**Pod 配置了过小的内存限制，无法容纳启动脚本的内存需求**。\n\n具体而言，容器 `aiops-case-v15/workload` 中的 `app` 容器在启动脚本中尝试分配 `256Mi` 内存（见事实 #5），但该容器的 `memory limit` 被硬限制配置为仅 `64Mi`（见事实 #4）。这种分配量远超限制的情况导致 Linux 内核 OOM Killer 立即终止了该进程（Exit Code 137，见事实 #3 和事实 #2），进而引发 Kubernetes 不断重启容器，表现为 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（见事实 #1）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 14.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 39.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v15/workload: 39.1s (Evidence 30.4s, RCA 8.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v15/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 62.781, "metrics": {"run_id": "79b3cac9a7fe478e", "mttr": {"value": "1.0m", "seconds": 62.78721022605896, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 62787.21022605896, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 59698.25887680054, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7377.946615219116, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2644.054889678955}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 14676.451683044434, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 39057.642459869385, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "e